### auth_lab.http — Authentication Gauntlet Lab
### Write your REST Client request blocks under each phase header.
### Run a block with Ctrl+Alt+R (Windows/Linux) or Cmd+Alt+R (macOS).
### Hint: all endpoints live under http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### PHASE 1 — Basic Authentication
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Phase 1 — Basic Auth (unauthenticated)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/basic/ HTTP/1.1

###

### Phase 1 — Basic Auth (with credentials)
# REST Client encodes username:password in Base64 automatically
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/basic/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

###

### Phase 2 — Synthesis: Impersonating admin without knowing the password
# An attacker who intercepts "Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=" off the wire can
# replay it directly — Base64 is reversible encoding, not encryption, so
# the string itself IS the credential. No decoding or cracking needed.
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/basic/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### PHASE 3 — Token Authentication (Opaque)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Phase 3 — Opaque Token Auth
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/token/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Token b40ff22952546789e51799f6af4b9559b6a9a5e7

###

### Phase 3 — Tampered Token
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/token/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Token b40ff22952546789e51799f6af4b9559b6a9a5e0


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### PHASE 4 — JSON Web Tokens (JWT)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Phase 4 — JWT Login (obtain tokens)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/jwt/login/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin123"
}

###

### Phase 4 — JWT Protected Request
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/jwt/protected/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkwMTc3MTQ2LCJpYXQiOjE3OTAxNzUzNDYsImp0aSI6IjUxZjJiN2E5NDdmODRlNmRhNjQ1ZjEwMGNlYmI3MjU2IiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjEifQ.8W7KizppaPNvQs4i5NmIpWfgNO0xowbHTxaptS0z5lw

###

### Phase 4 — Tampered JWT
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/jwt/protected/ HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkwMTc3MTQ2LCJpYXQiOjE3OTAxNzUzNDYsImp0aSI6IjUxZjJiN2E5NDdmODRlNmRhNjQ1ZjEwMGNlYmI3MjU2IiwidXNlcl9pZCI6IjIifQ.tamperedSignatureXXXX